  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "25595368",
      "title": "Getting The Most Out Of This Course",
      "sourceHash": "b6dd9b09b68f02dc8c69a4cd9d4446a88102e76acc678cb627679135f672c02c",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.63,
          "end": 2.82,
          "en": "Now, with this course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 2.82,
          "end": 7.44,
          "en": "I don't just wanna make sure that you have lots of content",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.44,
          "end": 9.78,
          "en": "and also different paths",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.78,
          "end": 13.65,
          "en": "for going through that content and that course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.65,
          "end": 15.3,
          "en": "but I also wanna make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.3,
          "end": 19.08,
          "en": "that you really get the most out of this course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 19.08,
          "end": 21.15,
          "en": "And that, of course, all starts",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 21.15,
          "end": 24.93,
          "en": "with you meeting the course prerequisites,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 24.93,
          "end": 29.07,
          "en": "because I really want to emphasize that for this course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 29.07,
          "end": 34.07,
          "en": "you need basic web development and JavaScript knowledge.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 35.34,
          "end": 37.71,
          "en": "There is an optional",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 37.71,
          "end": 40.74,
          "en": "JavaScript refresher course section",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 40.74,
          "end": 43.38,
          "en": "right after this section here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 43.38,
          "end": 46.32,
          "en": "which you can take if it's been some time",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 46.32,
          "end": 49.44,
          "en": "since you last worked with JavaScript",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 49.44,
          "end": 53.07,
          "en": "or if you only got started with JavaScript",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 53.07,
          "end": 54.63,
          "en": "a couple of months ago,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 54.63,
          "end": 57.81,
          "en": "but this section will not replace",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 57.81,
          "end": 60.6,
          "en": "a complete JavaScript course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 60.6,
          "end": 64.35,
          "en": "If you never worked with JavaScript at all",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 64.35,
          "end": 67.77,
          "en": "and if you got basically no web development knowledge,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 67.77,
          "end": 70.92,
          "en": "this course here won't be for you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 70.92,
          "end": 74.76,
          "en": "But this course definitely is for everyone",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 74.76,
          "end": 77.16,
          "en": "who got at least basic knowledge.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 77.16,
          "end": 81.45,
          "en": "No expert knowledge, no advanced knowledge is needed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 81.45,
          "end": 83.01,
          "en": "Basic knowledge is enough.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 83.01,
          "end": 85.68299999999999,
          "en": "But you should have that basic knowledge.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 86.58,
          "end": 87.99,
          "en": "Well, and then, of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 87.99,
          "end": 91.08,
          "en": "since this is a video-based course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 91.08,
          "end": 93.93,
          "en": "you should watch the course videos,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 93.93,
          "end": 97.25999999999999,
          "en": "but you should watch them at your pace.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 97.25999999999999,
          "end": 99.81,
          "en": "Slow me down if I'm going too fast",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 99.81,
          "end": 104.31,
          "en": "or speed me up if I'm going too slow for your taste.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 104.31,
          "end": 107.1,
          "en": "It's a video on-demand course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 107.1,
          "end": 109.35,
          "en": "Take advantage of that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 109.35,
          "end": 114.35,
          "en": "Also, feel free to pause the videos or rewatch videos",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 114.53999999999999,
          "end": 118.71000000000001,
          "en": "if a certain explanation isn't clear the first time",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 118.71000000000001,
          "end": 123.71,
          "en": "or if you need some time to think about a certain concept.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 124.56,
          "end": 128.16,
          "en": "Also, feel free to repeat entire sections.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 128.16,
          "end": 132.36,
          "en": "This is a normal part of learning something.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 132.36,
          "end": 135.36,
          "en": "Really take advantage of the fact",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 135.36,
          "end": 138.87,
          "en": "that this is a video on-demand course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 138.87,
          "end": 142.473,
          "en": "You don't need to rush it, and you shouldn't.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 143.34,
          "end": 148.34,
          "en": "What you should do, though, is practice what you learned",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 148.53,
          "end": 151.86,
          "en": "because only practice makes perfect.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 151.86,
          "end": 154.92000000000002,
          "en": "You are probably not going to learn React",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 154.92000000000002,
          "end": 157.53,
          "en": "by just watching the videos.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 157.53,
          "end": 162.12,
          "en": "Instead, you should complete those coding exercises",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 162.12,
          "end": 163.89,
          "en": "which you find in the course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 163.89,
          "end": 168.6,
          "en": "You should dive into those demo projects we're building.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 168.6,
          "end": 172.23,
          "en": "You should also pause the videos frequently",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 172.23,
          "end": 175.44,
          "en": "and try doing the next steps on your own.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 175.44,
          "end": 178.23,
          "en": "When we're building a demo project together,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 178.23,
          "end": 180.78,
          "en": "which we'll do a lot in this course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 180.78,
          "end": 184.233,
          "en": "feel free to pause and try it on your own.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 185.07,
          "end": 189.03,
          "en": "Also, build your own dummy demo projects",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 189.03,
          "end": 192.69,
          "en": "maybe inspired by the projects and demos",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 192.69,
          "end": 193.89,
          "en": "you see in this course",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 193.89,
          "end": 197.7,
          "en": "or maybe some other website you found out there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 197.7,
          "end": 200.28,
          "en": "because only by building stuff",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 200.28,
          "end": 203.13,
          "en": "and by applying your React knowledge",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 203.13,
          "end": 204.9,
          "en": "which you'll gain in this course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 204.9,
          "end": 209.9,
          "en": "only by doing that are you going to learn and master React.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 211.32,
          "end": 214.07999999999998,
          "en": "Now, of course, especially when practicing,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 214.07999999999998,
          "end": 217.82999999999998,
          "en": "you're probably also going to get stuck at some point,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 217.82999999999998,
          "end": 219.03,
          "en": "and therefore, of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 219.03,
          "end": 222.3,
          "en": "you should also help yourself and others.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 222.3,
          "end": 225.24,
          "en": "Now, if you're getting stuck with the demo projects",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 225.24,
          "end": 228.84,
          "en": "or in general the code you'll see in the videos,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 228.84,
          "end": 230.19,
          "en": "there's good news.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 230.19,
          "end": 234.63,
          "en": "I do provide code attachments as part of this course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 234.63,
          "end": 237.15,
          "en": "Indeed, attached to this lecture,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 237.15,
          "end": 238.86,
          "en": "you'll find a link to GitHub",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 238.86,
          "end": 242.04,
          "en": "where you'll find all those code snapshots",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 242.04,
          "end": 244.68,
          "en": "for the different course sections.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 244.68,
          "end": 249.21,
          "en": "You'll find multiple snapshots per section with titles",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 249.21,
          "end": 251.55,
          "en": "that should make it easy to identify",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 251.55,
          "end": 254.52,
          "en": "which snapshot belongs to which lecture",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 254.52,
          "end": 259.413,
          "en": "and you can use these snapshots to compare my code to yours.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 260.67,
          "end": 261.78,
          "en": "But in addition,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 261.78,
          "end": 265.44,
          "en": "you can, of course, also ask in the Q&A section",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 265.44,
          "end": 266.73,
          "en": "if you've got a problem,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 266.73,
          "end": 271.38,
          "en": "but I can really only encourage you to not just ask there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 271.38,
          "end": 273.75,
          "en": "but also answer.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 273.75,
          "end": 275.73,
          "en": "Help the other students",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 275.73,
          "end": 280.35,
          "en": "because by answering questions, by solving problems,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 280.35,
          "end": 284.61,
          "en": "therefore you are forced to apply your knowledge,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 284.61,
          "end": 287.73,
          "en": "to think about a problem deeply,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 287.73,
          "end": 291.81,
          "en": "and that therefore indeed is one of the main aspects",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 291.81,
          "end": 293.94,
          "en": "of becoming a better developer.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 293.94,
          "end": 298.14,
          "en": "So take this opportunity to help others.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 298.14,
          "end": 301.65,
          "en": "And also, don't just do that in the Q&A section.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 301.65,
          "end": 303.54,
          "en": "Instead, as part of this course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 303.54,
          "end": 307.08,
          "en": "you also get access to our Discord server.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 307.08,
          "end": 310.35,
          "en": "You'll find more details in the next lecture.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 310.35,
          "end": 312.6,
          "en": "And on that Discord server,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 312.6,
          "end": 315.93,
          "en": "you'll also find like-minded developers",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 315.93,
          "end": 318.87,
          "en": "so that you don't have to learn React on your own,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 318.87,
          "end": 322.08299999999997,
          "en": "but you can instead learn it together with others.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}